{
  "id": "MRK.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 15",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiti kuriphocha, akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka osi, phamwenga na alimu a Shariya na vilongozi anjina a Chiyahudi, yani angambi osi, akutana achibisha. Amfunga Jesu mikowa achimphirika kpwa Pilato, liwali wa jimbo ra Chirumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achimuuza, “We ndiwe Mfalume wa Ayahudi?” Naye achimuamba, “Kama uchivyogomba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka amshitaki na mambo manji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Pilato wamuuza tsona Jesu, “Sikira go mashitaka manji anagokushitakira. Dze, vino kundadzikanira?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 53:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kayajibu neno, hata Pilato achiangalala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawaida chila Sikukuu ya Pasaka, Pilato kala nkuavugurira Ayahudi mfungbwa mmwenga ariyemtsambula enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, kpwakala na mutu mmwenga yeihwa Baraba, ambaye kala akafungbwa phamwenga na atu anjina. Atu hinyo kala akahenda fujo na kuolaga atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundi kulu ra atu ramlunga Pilato achendamvoya aahendere kama kawaidaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achiauza, “Mnalonda nikuvugurireni Mfalume wa Ayahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato wagomba hivyo mana kala akamanya kukala, akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka kala akamreha Jesu kpwakpwe kpwa sababu ya chidzitso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka afyakatsira atu amuambe Pilato aavugurire Baraba badala ya Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achiauza tsona, “Vino mnalonda nimuhendedze yuno mumuihaye Mfalume wa Ayahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu achikota kululu chivyamwenga achiamba tsona, “Naakotwe msalabani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Pilato achiauza, “Kpwa utu wani? Kpwani wahenda uyi wani?” Ela nyo achizidi kukota kululu, achiamba, “Naakotwe msalabani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira Pilato kala analonda kufurahisha rira kundi ra atu, waavugurira Baraba. Achilagiza Jesu achapwe viboko sana, chisha achimlavya akakotwe msalabani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asikari amphirika Jesu dzumba ra liwali wa jimbo ra Chirumi, nao achiiha chikosi chosi cha asikari chichimzunguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimvwika kandzu ya zambarau, rangi ya chifalume, achisuka chiremba cha miya achimvwika chitswani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho achiandza kumlamusa achimuamba, “Ikpwa ni Mlungu, mfalume wa Ayahudi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimchapa chitswani na mlawa na achimtehera mahe na achidzihenda anachita mavwindi mbereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kumnyetera, amvula hira kandzu ya zambarau, achimvwika nguwoze. Chisha achimphirika kpwendakotwa msalabani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
