        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kala ni kama saa sita za mutsi, na kpwakala na jiza tsi ndzima hadi saa tisiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saa tisiya iriphofika, Jesu warira na kululu achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Manage ni, “Mlungu wangu, Mlungu wangu, mbona ukaniricha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu anjina ariokala akaima phephi ariphosikira hivyo aamba, “Phundzani! Anamuiha Elija.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 69:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu mmwenga wazola achendahala demu achirivwika uchi wa ngbwadu, achirigbwadzika mgongoni. Chisha achimupha Jesu afyondze, achiamba, “Godzani, hulole ichikala Elija andakpwedzamtsereza msalabani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
