        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.8.2+LUK.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 8:2–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya phakala na achetu ambao kala aimire kure chidide kulola. Anjina aho kala ni Maryamu kula Magidala, Salome, phamwenga na Maryamu ninengbwa wa Jose na Jakobo mdide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinya kala achimlunga-lunga Jesu ariphokala Galilaya ili amuhumikire. Piya phakala na achetu anjina anji ambao kala akedza Jerusalemu phamwenga naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo kala ni Ijumaa, dzuwa kala rinatswa, wakati wa kuandza Siku ya Kuoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi phakpwedza Yusufu mwenyezi wa Arimathaya, ariyeishimiwa sana. Iye piya kala anagodzera kpwa hamu ufalume wa Mlungu. Phahi, wamlunga Pilato bila chiwewe, achivoya ahewe mwiri wa Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato waangalala ariphosikira kukala Jesu kala akafwa kare. Phahi wamuiha mkpwulu wa asikari, achilonda kumanya ichikala ni kpweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato ariphoambirwa ni hiye mkpwulu wa asikari kukala Jesu akafwa, wamruhusu Yusufu kuuhala hura mwiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Yusufu wagula shanda ya katani, achitsereza hura mwiri, achiulinga-linga hira shanda. Chisha achiwiika mbirani, mbira ambayo kala ikatsongbwa mwambani, achipingilisira dziwe phara mryangoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
